codex
A major dependency mismatch is emerging: the “local-only” R2 is not isolated from v1 DaoStream. The current REPL injects its local stream into Yin.VM, and Yin.VM itself operates that stream through the v1 protocols. I’m tracing those call sites now because this determines whether the plan’s claimed scope can work at all without a VM compatibility boundary or a broader migration.
